"'Site') from any device and when communicating with the Organization in any "
"form, in accordance with this Policy."
msgstr ""

#: .\apps\core\templates\core\docs\privacy_policy.html:36
msgid ""
"This Policy determines what personal data we may collect and how we may use "
"it."
msgstr ""

#: .\apps\core\templates\core\docs\privacy_policy.html:40
msgid ""
"This Policy applies to personal data that the data subject (hereinafter "
"referred to as the 'User' or 'Data Subject') provides to us when using our "
"websites, other services, platforms, products, and services that collect "
"data and display this Policy for users (each referred to as a 'Site,' and "
